{"id":491,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"On a moonless night, a strange incident occurred in which every one of a village's inhabitants suffered nightmares. The villagers attested that Darkrai appeared before them in these nightmares."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","Diamond"],"text":"It can lull people to sleep and make them dream. It is active during nights of the new moon."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It chases people and Pokémon from its territory by causing them to experience deep, nightmarish slumbers."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"To protect itself, it afflicts those around it with nightmares. However, it means no harm."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"Folklore has it that on moonless nights, this Pokémon will make people see horrific nightmares."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Bad Dreams","hidden":false,"description":"Damages opposing Pokémon that are asleep."}],"eggGroups":["Undiscovered"],"genderRate":-1,"hatchCounter":120,"baseHappiness":0,"growthRate":"slow","habitat":null,"color":"Black","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":491,"name":"Darkrai","condition":null,"children":[]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,50],[11,98],[20,95],[29,389],[38,101],[47,104],[57,114],[66,464],[75,417],[84,138],[93,399]],"machine":[59,280,347,451,109,174,399,409,203,263,374,411,264,492,416,114,506,63,58,196,282,808,417,101,398,182,244,94,473,240,156,157,317,184,247,421,214,188,555,180,164,241,129,14,269,851,168,675,87,86,271,261,404],"egg":[],"tutor":[]},"cards":[{"id":"me5-116","name":"Mega Darkrai ex","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Special Illustration Rare","number":"116","artist":"AKIRA EGAWA","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-116/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me5-116/large"},{"id":"me5-48","name":"Mega Darkrai ex","set":"Pitch Black","date":"2026-07-17","rarity":"Double Rare","number":"48","artist":"5ban Graphics","small":"htt